# Keeps `vercel deploy` uploads from the repo root (cloud build with
# Root Directory = apps/nex32scan) small and clean — see apps/nex32scan/DEPLOY.md.

# Build output — always rebuilt on Vercel
**/.next/
**/dist/
**/.turbo/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage/

# Prebuilt CLI output (only relevant to the local --prebuilt flow)
.vercel/output/

# Local quiz-chain data — the app ships a baked snapshot in src/generated/
.chain-data/

# Local env files — cloud builds must read env from the Vercel dashboard
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Local service logs
*.log
